            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\n\nAs the error suggests, `MiniExtra.pickers.lsp` requires setting explicit [scope](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/581724ebb39f4aa70bdbffb891d57d6141d29035/doc/mini-extra.txt#L616-L617). Here is the list of [supported scopes](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/581724ebb39f4aa70bdbffb891d57d6141d29035/doc/mini-extra.txt#L593-L599) and here are [examples of how to use it](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/581724ebb39f4aa70bdbffb891d57d6141d29035/doc/mini-extra.txt#L609-L611). It was like that since the initial implementation about 16 months ago.\n\nClosing as everything working as expected.",
